.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-HOOKS 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-hooks \- Bundle, install, uninstall or check quipu\*(Aqs Claude Code and Codex hooks
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu hooks\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bundle, install, uninstall or check quipu\*(Aqs Claude Code and Codex hooks
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-hooks\-bundle(1)
Print quipu\*(Aqs hook bundle (st.hook\-bundle/1)
.TP
quipu\-hooks\-install(1)
Install quipu\*(Aqs hooks into Claude Code or Codex
.TP
quipu\-hooks\-uninstall(1)
Remove quipu\*(Aqs hooks from Claude Code or Codex
.TP
quipu\-hooks\-status(1)
Report whether quipu\*(Aqs hooks are installed
.TP
quipu\-hooks\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
